# This repo is public. Aly's actual wardrobe is not.
#
# The app code, taxonomy, and engine are all fine in the open — they're the
# interesting part and none of it is sensitive. What stays out is anything that
# describes her specifically: what she owns, what it looks like, what she wears,
# and the style analysis derived from her boards.
#
# The real home for all of it is Firestore, which is where the app reads it
# from anyway. These local files are a working copy for the Python scripts.

photos/
data/*
!data/*.example.md
!data/*.example.json

# Credentials never live in the repo — see README.
*.env
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
